===Rivalries===
*Luis Ángel Firpo v. [[Alianza F.C. (El Salvador)|Alianza]]. The match is known as ''(Clásico Joven)'' (Young classic) Although Alianza has one more title than Firpo.
*Luis Ángel Firpo v. [[C.D. Águila|Águila]]. The match is known as ''(Clásico de Oriente)'' (Eastern Classic). They are from the same Zone.
*One smallest but stronger and old rivalry could be Luis Ángel Firpo v. [[C.D. FAS|FAS]].

== Supporters ==
Despite having a growing fan base across the country, there were no official fan groups until 1990 when Manuel Viagra founded the "Furia Pampera" in [[Usulután]].<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.elgrafico.com/futbol/La-poderosa-barra-del-Firpo-que-vendr-para-el-Clausura-2018-20180108-0027.html|title=La poderosa barra del Firpo que vendrá para el Clausura 2018|website=elgrafico.com|access-date=April 11, 2018|archive-date=January 9, 2018|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180109085208/https://www.elgrafico.com/futbol/La-poderosa-barra-del-Firpo-que-vendr-para-el-Clausura-2018-20180108-0027.html|url-status=live}}</ref>
They are currently the second largest fan base in San Salvador and the fourth largest nationwide.{{Citation needed|date=July 2025}}

